     "<strong>6.</strong> <img class=\"formula\" src=\"media/formulak/00aa_02logika/f0615.svg\" alt=\"forall x (x in u &lt;-&gt; x in w)\" style=\"width:9.997em;height:1.001em\" loading=\"lazy\"> — helburua.",
